author: "harness:claude-code"
acceptance_criteria: "One canonical status-token normalizer exists and the other call sites import it rather than restate it; jaccardSimilarity has one implementation, and the SDK and CLI paths resolve to it; Any surviving intentional replication of these rules is declared in surface-replication-sets.json so drift fails the gate"
